sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Client app / agent
    participant API as FastAPI /v1
    participant Pool as Concurrency pool
    participant Reaper as Reaper
    participant CLI as kiro-cli

    App->>API: POST /v1/chat/completions
    API->>API: flatten messages -> prompt
    API->>Pool: acquire slot (semaphore)
    alt queue full and reject_when_busy
        Pool-->>API: BusyError
        API-->>App: 429 Too Many Requests
    else slot acquired
        Pool->>CLI: spawn chat --no-interactive (prompt on stdin)
        Pool->>Reaper: track(pid, hard deadline)
        alt completes in time
            CLI-->>Pool: stdout (reply)
        else timeout / client disconnect
            Pool->>CLI: SIGKILL process group
        end
        Pool->>Reaper: untrack(pid) + reap
        Pool-->>API: text + token estimate
        API-->>App: OpenAI chat.completion (or SSE stream)
    end
